Charva is a GUI toolkit for terminals.

This would make creation of menus and windows in NetHack easier.
The benefit would probably not be that big. The GUI abstraction of
NetHack is already quite good.

But Charva doesn't really have functions for drawing freely into the
terminal.

Although somebody in here already suggested that it might be possible to
simulate that by a series of JLabels with different attributes.

